abstract: >-
  A PyTorch library for solving time-dependent partial differential equations
  using Runge-Kutta Physics-Informed Neural Networks (RK-PINNs). The library
  implements time-discrete loss formulations using Gauss-Legendre, Radau IIA,
  and Lobatto IIIA collocation methods with boundary-conditioned neural ansatz.
